        content: "MongoDB最流行文档型NoSQL，BSON(二进制JSON)存储，数据灵活无需预定义表结构。核心概念：Database→Collection集合(对应SQL表)→Document文档(对应行)。索引支持单字段、复合、地理空间、文本、TTL自动过期。聚合管道Aggregation Pipeline多阶段处理：$match过滤、$group分组、$sort排序、$lookup类似JOIN。复制集Replica Set高可用1主多从+仲裁，自动故障转移。分片集群Sharded Cluster通过Shard Key水平扩展，范围/哈希分片。适用日志、内容、实时分析；不适合强事务复杂JOIN。",
        example: "// MongoDB 查询实例\n\n// 插入文档\ndb.users.insertOne({\n  name: \"Tom\", age: 25,\n  hobbies: [\"coding\", \"reading\"],\n  address: { city: \"Beijing\", zip: \"100000\" }\n})\n\n// 查询\ndb.users.find({ \"address.city\": \"Beijing\" })\ndb.users.find({ age: { $gte: 20, $lte: 30 } })\n\n// 聚合管道\ndb.orders.aggregate([\n  { $match: { status: \"completed\" } },\n  { $group: { _id: \"$user_id\", total: { $sum: \"$amount\" } } },\n  { $sort: { total: -1 } },\n  { $limit: 10 }\n])\n\n// 创建索引\ndb.users.createIndex({ email: 1 }, { unique: true })"
